  "description": "The Matrix and Flower Power offer a carefully curated mix of KID-FIT components to provide the utmost in safety, comfort, and function. 16\" models come standard with training wheels and a coaster brake for beginners developing their riding skills. 20\" models drop the training wheels and add a rear hand brake in addition to the coaster so more advanced riders can begin to refine their braking technique.\nHigh-tensile steel frame with low stand over for small riders\nSingle-speed drivetrain\nKt coaster brake\nKID-FIT one-piece steel crank and nylon pedals\nSteel rims and spokes\n16\" x 2.125\" multi-condition tires\nKID-FIT steel BMX handlebar and rubber grips\nKID-FIT padded saddle\nSteel chain guard\nRemovable training wheels",
